It is midday.
Rohan and I are going to the office canteen.
We are taking a break from our screens.
There are many people in the canteen.
They are eating their lunch.
We sit at an empty table.
I am opening my lunchbox.
I bring food from home every day.
Rohan is bringing his food from the counter.
There are hot dal and rice on his plate.
Rohan sits on the chair in front of me.
"Maya, what are you eating?" Rohan asks.
"I am eating roti and sabzi," I tell him.
Rohan is also eating his food.
We eat comfortably together.
We are not talking about work right now.
I like this break a lot.
We finish our food.
We clean our table.
Now we are going back to work.
